        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Cash Flow Statement - Following the Money",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Read it as three buckets summing to the cash delta.** Operating is the engine; investing is\nthe spend on the future; financing is dealings with lenders and owners."
    },
