        "section": "accounting",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Cash Flow Statement - Following the Money",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Activity | Sign convention | Healthy pattern (mature firm) |\n|----------|----------------|-------------------------------|\n| **Operating (CFO)** | Inflow positive | Strongly positive — the engine works |\n| **Investing (CFI)** | Outflow negative | Negative — investing in growth (capex) |\n| **Financing (CFF)** | Either | Often negative — returning cash (dividends, buybacks, debt paydown) |"
    },
