        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "The Cash Flow Statement - Following the Money",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "A textbook-healthy mature company shows **+CFO, −CFI, −CFF**: it generates cash, reinvests\nsome, and returns the rest. A startup often shows −CFO, −CFI, +CFF (burning cash, investing,\nraising money). The *pattern* is diagnostic."
